    "text": "Simon the Cyrene's song - see [[Mark.15.21]] where Rufus' father is compelled to carry Jesus' cross.",
    "created": "2026-06-20T13:54:51.845Z",
    "updated": "2026-06-20T13:55:55.876Z",
    "tags": []
