    "updated": "2026-07-20T12:57:49.507Z",
    "created": "2026-07-19T16:11:27.980Z",
    "text": "\"the wonderful works of God\"!",
    "tags": []
  },
  "Matt.24.13": {
    "text": "The believer is called to persevere despite increasing deception, persecution, and lawlessness. The faithful remnant remains steadfast even while \"many\" fall away.",
    "created": "2026-06-18T20:24:53.062Z",
    "updated": "2026-06-18T20:24:53.062Z",
    "tags": []
  },
  "John.13.5": {
    "updated": "2026-07-21T12:29:44.012Z",
    "created": "2026-07-21T12:14:42.240Z",
    "text": "See [[Rom.10.15]] (the gospel of peace) and [[Eph.6.15]] (armor of God) and also ",
    "tags": [
