      "Peace",
      "humility",
      "meekness"
    ]
  },
  "Rom.8.1": {
    "text": "No more condemnation! See [[John.3.17]], Jesus' words to Nicodemus. To be \"In Christ\" - [[2Cor.5.17]]",
    "created": "2026-06-15T23:15:43.883Z",
    "tags": [
      "Condemnation",
      "In Christ"
    ],
    "updated": "2026-07-22T16:13:43.191Z"
  },
  "Matt.7.23": {
    "updated": "2026-07-20T23:52:16.313Z",
    "created": "2026-06-25T19:38:37.540Z",
    "text": "Contrast with Paul's words on the importance of love in [[1Cor.13.2]]!",
    "tags": [
      "love"
    ]
  },
  "1Cor.13.3": {
    "updated": "2026-07-20T23:52:27.596Z",
    "created": "2026-06-25T17:58:35.349Z",
    "text": "vs 1 speak in tongues, but without love, \"sounding brass or tinkling cymbal\" (just noise)\nvs 2: gift of prophecy/understand mysteries/knowledge of Word/great faith, but without love - \"I am nothing\"\nvs 3: give all to poor/martyr, but without love - \"profits me nothing\"\nXref with [[Matt.7.23]]!",
    "tags": [
      "love"
    ]
  },
  "Rom.4.24": {
    "text": "That same imputed righteousness that Abraham received is also available for us, if we can display that same faith. [[Gen.15.6]] See also [[Jas.2.23]]",
    "created": "2026-06-20T13:46:50.160Z",
    "updated": "2026-06-20T21:49:49.992Z",
    "tags": []
  },
